---
import InfoLayout from '../layouts/InfoLayout.astro';
import { contactEmail, legalUpdated, siteName } from '../lib/site';
---

<InfoLayout
  title="Terms and Conditions | Timezone Prime"
  description="The terms for using Timezone Prime, a free time zone converter: acceptable use, accuracy of conversions, intellectual property and limitation of liability."
  heading="Terms and conditions"
  lead="The rules for using Timezone Prime. Please read them, because using the site means you accept them."
  crumb="Terms and conditions"
  path="/terms-and-conditions/"
  updated={legalUpdated}
>
  <p>
    These terms apply to your use of {siteName} at timezoneprime.com ("the site", "we", "us"). If you do not agree with
    them, please do not use the site.
  </p>

  <h2>Using the site</h2>
  <p>
    The site is free to use for personal and business purposes. You agree not to misuse it, which includes trying to
    disrupt or overload it, scraping it in a way that degrades the service for others, or using it for anything
    unlawful.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy of conversions</h2>
  <p>
    We work hard to make every conversion correct. Results are calculated from the IANA time zone database built into
    your browser, so they depend on your browser being up to date. Governments sometimes change time zone or daylight
    saving rules at short notice, and there may be a delay before those changes reach your device.
  </p>
  <p>
    For anything where a wrong time would be costly, such as flights, legal deadlines, financial markets or medical
    schedules, please confirm the time with an official source.
  </p>

  <h2>No warranty</h2>
  <p>
    The site is provided "as is" and "as available", without warranties of any kind, express or implied, including
    accuracy, fitness for a particular purpose and uninterrupted availability. We may change, suspend or stop any part
    of the site at any time.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the fullest extent the law allows, {siteName} is not liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of the
    site or reliance on its results, including missed meetings, travel or business losses. Nothing in these terms limits
    liability that cannot be limited by law.
  </p>

  <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    The site's design, text and code belong to {siteName}. You are welcome to link to any page and to share results you
    get from the converter. Please do not copy the site or republish large parts of its content without permission.
  </p>
  <p>
    Map boundaries come from
    <a href="https://github.com/evansiroky/timezone-boundary-builder" rel="noopener" target="_blank"
      >Timezone Boundary Builder</a
    > under the Open Database License, and time zone rules come from the public-domain IANA tz database.
  </p>

  <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
  <p>
    Links to other websites are provided for convenience. We do not control those sites and are not responsible for
    their content.
  </p>

  <h2>Privacy</h2>
  <p>
    How we handle information is described in the <a href="/privacy-policy/" data-astro-reload>privacy policy</a>,
    which forms part of these terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms from time to time. The date at the top shows when they last changed. Continuing to use the
    site after a change means you accept the updated terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about these terms can go to <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a> or through the
    <a href="/contact/" data-astro-reload>contact page</a>.
  </p>
</InfoLayout>
